{"4551870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ruffed Up", "steam_appid": 4551870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4816870, 4960360], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your walker to safety before they get RUFFED UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After disaster strikes and your dog walker is knocked out, you and your fellow dogs must work together to save them! In this 2 - 4 player game, use your leashes to pull the walker through the streets of Slop Friendcisco. Avoid dangers and keep the walker alive as you navigate towards the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/56b035a451a9e96c29de786d2b2635a3.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/56b035a451a9e96c29de786d2b2635a3.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/56b035a451a9e96c29de786d2b2635a3.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This city’s gone to the dogs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to navigate your walker through the districts of Slop Friendcisco and beyond. Dodge speeding cars, balance on tricky platforms, and avoid haywire machinery as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/e2996d9736cf1ca19d928f16efa21939.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/e2996d9736cf1ca19d928f16efa21939.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/e2996d9736cf1ca19d928f16efa21939.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >These old dogs have learned some new tricks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, dash, pull, and swing your way to success. Or just annoy your friends with endless, incessant barking. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/24217c312080f422def59f0cbd2c05f4.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/24217c312080f422def59f0cbd2c05f4.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/24217c312080f422def59f0cbd2c05f4.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Doggy Styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pooch with different coat patterns, ears, tails, harnesses, and hats. Talk about looking fetching!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/ecd3df7f40f25bd49fa203c38694ea99.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/ecd3df7f40f25bd49fa203c38694ea99.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/ecd3df7f40f25bd49fa203c38694ea99.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Steam’s very first AAA 4D platformer!*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*that’s ‘Arf Arf Arf’ and 4 Dogs, respectively</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your walker to safety before they get RUFFED UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After disaster strikes and your dog walker is knocked out, you and your fellow dogs must work together to save them! In this 2 - 4 player game, use your leashes to pull the walker through the streets of Slop Friendcisco. Avoid dangers and keep the walker alive as you navigate towards the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/56b035a451a9e96c29de786d2b2635a3.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/56b035a451a9e96c29de786d2b2635a3.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/56b035a451a9e96c29de786d2b2635a3.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This city’s gone to the dogs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to navigate your walker through the districts of Slop Friendcisco and beyond. Dodge speeding cars, balance on tricky platforms, and avoid haywire machinery as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/e2996d9736cf1ca19d928f16efa21939.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/e2996d9736cf1ca19d928f16efa21939.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/e2996d9736cf1ca19d928f16efa21939.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >These old dogs have learned some new tricks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, dash, pull, and swing your way to success. Or just annoy your friends with endless, incessant barking. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/24217c312080f422def59f0cbd2c05f4.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/24217c312080f422def59f0cbd2c05f4.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/24217c312080f422def59f0cbd2c05f4.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Doggy Styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pooch with different coat patterns, ears, tails, harnesses, and hats. Talk about looking fetching!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/ecd3df7f40f25bd49fa203c38694ea99.poster.avif?t=1786734676\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/ecd3df7f40f25bd49fa203c38694ea99.webm?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/extras/ecd3df7f40f25bd49fa203c38694ea99.mp4?t=1786734676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Steam’s very first AAA 4D platformer!*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*that’s ‘Arf Arf Arf’ and 4 Dogs, respectively</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Ruffed Up is a chaotic co-op physics game where you play as dogs dragging your unconscious dog walker back home. Team up with 2–4 players online or locally to keep your human safe, cross treacherous terrain, dodge hazards, and somehow get everyone home in one piece. It’s no walk in the park!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/8cd98f328a8c04a7dc7be1eb717cdd6138ef8f16/header.jpg?t=1786734676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/70f00e3d171987e7f7e6770abebf39fc6f978e38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786734676", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551870/70f00e3d171987e7f7e6770abebf39fc6f978e38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786734676", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970 / Radeon RX580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A high-speed internet connection and a good connection between players are required to play online</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 / AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070 / Radeon RX 5700XT<br></li><li><strong>Direc